  "details": "When trying to join an instance of a group I'm already a member of, I get a 403 error.\n\nThe world doesn't appear in the group's instance list.\n\nThe group's permission assignment feature is not being used.\n\nRestarting the game and PC doesn't fix it.\n\nRejoining the group doesn't fix it.\n\nDeleting content, user data, and texture caches doesn't fix it.\n\nDeleting user data is not attempted because the loss is too great.\n\nThis has happened before, but at that time, rejoining the group resolved the issue.\n\nI was able to join without any problems for a while (about a year), but it has recurred now, making it even more troublesome.\n\nThe problem is not reproducible, and the cause is unknown.",
